---
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const title = "Terms of Service | ZDentistry";
const description = "Terms of service for ZDentistry dental clinic in Cuttack. Read about our policies regarding appointments, treatments, payments, and more.";
---

<PageLayout title={title} description={description} noindex={true}>
  <section class="section bg-white">
    <div class="container-custom max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-secondary-900 mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-8">Last updated: February 2025</p>

      <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none space-y-8">
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          Welcome to ZDentistry. By accessing our website or using our dental services, you agree to the following terms and conditions. Please read them carefully.
        </p>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-3">1. Appointments and Scheduling</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
            <li>Appointments can be booked via phone, WhatsApp, or our online booking system.</li>
            <li>We request that you arrive on time for your scheduled appointment. Late arrivals may result in reduced treatment time or rescheduling.</li>
            <li>If you need to cancel or reschedule, please notify us at least 24 hours in advance so we can accommodate other patients.</li>
            <li>ZDentistry reserves the right to reschedule appointments due to emergencies or unforeseen circumstances.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-3">2. Treatment and Consent</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
            <li>All dental treatments will be explained to you beforehand, including the procedure, expected outcomes, risks, and alternatives.</li>
            <li>Written or verbal consent will be obtained before any treatment is performed.</li>
            <li>Treatment plans are based on clinical assessment and may be adjusted as treatment progresses.</li>
            <li>Patients are encouraged to disclose their full medical history, current medications, and any allergies to ensure safe treatment.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-3">3. Fees and Payment</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
            <li>Treatment fees will be communicated to you before commencing any procedure.</li>
            <li>We accept payments via cash, credit/debit cards, and UPI.</li>
            <li>For extensive treatment plans, payment schedules may be arranged upon discussion with the clinic.</li>
            <li>Fees are subject to change. Any changes will be communicated prior to treatment.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-3">4. Patient Responsibilities</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
            <li>Patients are responsible for providing accurate and complete health information.</li>
            <li>Follow all post-treatment instructions provided by the dentist for optimal recovery.</li>
            <li>Attend scheduled follow-up appointments as recommended.</li>
            <li>Inform the clinic of any changes to your health or medications between visits.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-3">5. Treatment Outcomes</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700">
            While we strive for the best possible results, dental treatment outcomes can vary depending on individual health conditions, compliance with post-treatment care, and other factors. ZDentistry does not guarantee specific results. Our team will provide honest assessments and work with you to achieve the best outcome for your dental health.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-3">6. Emergency Care</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700">
            ZDentistry provides emergency dental care during clinic hours. For dental emergencies outside regular hours, please call our emergency line at <a href="tel:+918984489929" class="text-primary hover:underline">+91 89844 89929</a>. We will make every effort to attend to urgent cases as promptly as possible.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-3">7. Website Use</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
            <li>The content on this website is for informational purposes only and does not constitute medical advice.</li>
            <li>Information on treatments, procedures, and dental health is general in nature and should not be used as a substitute for professional dental consultation.</li>
            <li>We make reasonable efforts to keep the website information accurate and up to date, but we do not warrant its completeness or accuracy.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-3">8. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700">
            All content on this website, including text, images, logos, and design, is the property of ZDentistry and is protected by applicable intellectual property laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, or use any content from this website without prior written permission.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-3">9. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700">
            ZDentistry shall not be held liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the use of our website or services, to the extent permitted by law. Our liability for any treatment is limited to the fees paid for that specific treatment.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-3">10. Changes to These Terms</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700">
            We reserve the right to modify these Terms of Service at any time. Changes will be effective upon posting on this page. Continued use of our website or services after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-3">11. Governing Law</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700">
            These terms are governed by the laws of India. Any disputes arising from these terms or our services shall be subject to the jurisdiction of the courts in Cuttack, Odisha.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-3">12. Contact Us</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700">
            If you have any questions about these Terms of Service, please reach out to us:
          </p>
          <div class="mt-3 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-gray-700">
            <p class="font-semibold text-secondary-900">ZDentistry</p>
            <p>2B / 109, Near Jugal Kishore Park, CDA Sector-9, Cuttack, Odisha 753014</p>
            <p>Phone: <a href="tel:+918984489929" class="text-primary hover:underline">+91 89844 89929</a></p>
            <p>Email: <a href="mailto:zdentistrydentaloffice@gmail.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">zdentistrydentaloffice@gmail.com</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
